# Copy this file to .env (gitignored) and put your real key there. Never commit .env.
#
# API key for testing API mode only (console.anthropic.com > API Keys).
# Claude Code bills ANTHROPIC_API_KEY instead of your subscription wherever it is set,
# and `claude -p` uses it without asking. So load this file only in the one terminal
# you test API mode in, and make sure nothing loads it automatically: for example,
# turn off VS Code's "python.terminal.useEnvFile", which puts .env into its terminals.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=replace-with-your-key
